# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Realms of Power: Magic — Magic Things (Lore)

**Version:** 0.4
**Source:** Realms of Power: Magic (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Chapter Eight: vis (extraordinary, dedicated, insubstantial, storage), Things of Virtue (herbs, objects, formed stones, trees, awakened items) and elementals. Things of Virtue are records in arm5e-rop-magic-0.5-things-of-virtue.ttrpg, each now carrying its verbatim write-up (recovered by a column-aware re-extraction of the source PDF — the HTML slice was displaced). The example vis sources, the new elemental spells and the elemental Powers are records in the sibling arm5e-rop-magic-0.5-{vis-sources,spells,creature-powers}.ttrpg files. The book's record-shaped content is double-captured here in narrative context where the HTML permits (spec: double-capture is correct).

